unt":32201,"watchers_count":32201,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":1455,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":155,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["asmjs","concurrency","elm","emscripten","gui","hacktoberfest","jsx","multithreading","rust","wasm","web","web-framework","webworkers"],"visibility":"public","forks":1455,"open_issues":155,"watchers":32201,"default_branch":"master","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"# This is a tracking issue for the upcoming `v0.19.0` release 🎉 \r\n\r\nThere are a number of things that I think _should_ be completed before release and some others that would be nice to see included but shouldn't prevent the release. None of this is set in stone and I welcome everyone to comment below whether you think something should be added or removed from either list!\r\n\r\n## Blocking (in no particular order):\r\n- [x] #2034\r\n- [x] #2035 (this issue exists in the `master` example too)\r\n- [x] #1946\r\n- [x] #1852 \r\n- [x] #1642 \r\n- [x] #2061\r\n- [x] #2056\r\n- [x] #2072\r\n- [x] #2116\r\n- [x] #2161\r\n- [x] #2168\r\n- [x] #2185\r\n\r\n## Notable but not blocking (in no particular order): \r\n- #1851 \r\n- #1844 \r\n- #1858 \r\n- #1860 \r\n- #1892 \r\n- #1891\r\n- #1853 \r\n- #1633 \r\n- #1609\r\n- #925\r\n- #2048\r\n- #2050\r\n\r\n## Issues that can be closed by new release\r\n- #1986 \r\n- #1985\r\n- #1045\r\n\r\nTwo of these issues are about services that are going to be removed, so can't be fixed, and one is a more general\r\ncritique of the router which has been re-written.\r\n\r\n## Misc\r\n\r\nSome extra bits to do befo